      "content": "thanks for the info. i'm seeing that purplish tint you mentioned in the shady areas under my big maple tree. do you think i should just go with a high nitrogen fertilizer to fix the yellowing, or is there a specific ratio you'd suggest for a lawn in this kind of climate?",
